own of Dial: dial-step! closes the ws handle when the step responds gone; idempotent via closable?/close!; then the host feeds :ws/closed, and the projection closes the ring. Architecturally sound: the composition that owns the connection tears down the connection — per stance rule 5. Let's verify lines 585-650 of dial-step! and establish! in ws_project.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now"}]}}
