write.\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I've verified everything firsthand: the `link-step!` implementation (remote.cljc:1105–1129), deadline stamping across all send paths (`send-request!` pending-lookup-first at 462–466, `refl-append` 927, `send-named!` 990–993, `count-ask!` never touching `:deadline`), `channel-loss!` (698–711), `dial-step!` multi-arity with the guarded `some? now` (600–"}]}}
