s, the §2 failure-table expiry rows, the §3 S2c test plan and the §4 doc amendments faithfully. Deadline discipline is verified on every path: stamped at first existence (accepted or kept), kept probes carry their original deadline (the pending lookup precedes the cond in `send-request!`, so a retry never restamps), waiting probes unstamped until `admit-probe!`, `count-ask!"}]}}
